# Walkthrough: Cloud Sync & Password Recovery

I've implemented a robust **Cloud Sync** and **Security** system for your application. Here's how everything works.

## New Features

### 1. Secret Recovery Phrase (Forgot Password)
- **Safe Setup**: When you first set up your shop, you'll be asked for a **"Secret Recovery Phrase"**.
- **Self-Service Reset**: If you ever forget your password, click the **"Forgot Password?"** link on the login screen.
- **How it works**: Enter your username and your Secret Phrase to set a brand new password immediately!

### 2. Multi-Device Cloud Login
- **Access Anywhere**: Open your app link on any device.
- **Automatic Sync**: Once you log in, your products and sales records will automatically download from the cloud.
- **Real-Time backup**: Every change you make is saved to the cloud within 5 seconds automatically.

## How to Get Started

1.  **Configure Firebase**: Go to **Manage → Cloud** and follow the instructions to link your Firebase project (one-time setup).
2.  **Initial Setup**: On the first login, create your Admin Username, Password, and **Secret Recovery Phrase**.
3.  **Share the Link**: Give your managers the ID and Password. They can log in from their own phones and see everything!

---

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Keep your Recovery Phrase safe**: Just like your password, anyone with your Recovery Phrase can reset your account and access your store data.

